ianeta Guilst","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mentre Shiki e gli altri si precipitano a salvare Rebecca, Weisz torna sulla Edens Zero assieme a una donna di nome Homura.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-06-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/q65uOQmXlJEByv7xn5QrqP338WH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q65uOQmXlJEByv7xn5QrqP338WH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"2817872","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Piano di fuga senza vestiti","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Homura usa i suoi poteri Soul Blade per respingere gli uomini di Sister. Nel frattempo Rebecca pianifica la fuga dalla Illega Tower.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-06-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":5.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7Zf2PgmES8WssmtGvWG3NTyvrke.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7Zf2PgmES8WssmtGvWG3NTyvrke.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"2817873","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Sister Ivry","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Il Cronofago si avvicina inesorabilmente al pianeta Guilst e Shiki è disgustato nel vedere che Sister usa Jinn come scudo. Poi improvvisamente appare un'altra Sister!","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-06-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ubqeKJZdrntqgrgzcgBcOlLZXyj.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ubqeKJZdrntqgrgzcgBcOlLZXyj.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"2817874","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Nuove amicizie","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"