tta con Nino.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-09-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e4n2MRwrB6DrbkIXs7RMxclHUMF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e4n2MRwrB6DrbkIXs7RMxclHUMF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/24"},{"id":"2865827","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":25,"title":{"value":"Qualcuno da amare","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Alla fine della battaglia tra il Dragone Kurenai e Shiki, questa torna con i suoi sull'Edens Zero per condividere le brutte notizie con il resto della squadra.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-10-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iBMMoXepXQp3HFz2N01GlUhs1iN.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iBMMoXepXQp3HFz2N01GlUhs1iN.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/25"},{"id":"4331783","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":26,"title":{"value":"Belial Gore","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After defeating Madame Kurenai and leaving the planet Sun Jewel, Shiki and his comrades continue their journey and attempt to infiltrate Belial Gore, the enormous urban-type battleship of Drakken Joe, who has been targeting Edens Zero.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-04-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/34u4izZnt5WU0vE5cFMIHg7Ogtq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/34u4izZnt5WU0vE5cFMIHg7Ogtq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/26"},{"id":"4342482","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":27,"title":{"value":"Element 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Shiki and his gang believe they have successfully infiltrated Belial Gore, but Drakken Joe had been aware of their every move and sends out his elite military force, the Element 4, to take down Shiki's group.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-04-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ioYjrIVWqgCMbwGNspxRDGE0PQ8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ioYjrIVWqgCMbwGNspxRDGE0PQ8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/27"},{"id":"4342483","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":28,"title":{"value":"Il vento soffia per il Sakura Cosmos","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Within the Belial Gore, Weisz dons an Arsenal suit in his fight against the Element 4 Spirit of Water, Laguna. However, he finds it difficult to gain the upper hand due to Laguna's various water attacks.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-04-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p2trJcXIjBjnJ4JonxShd4Ctep5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p2trJcXIjBjnJ4JonxShd4Ctep5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/28"},{"id":"4342484","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":29,"title":{"value":"Numero 29","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Although Rebecca and Happy go into Belial Gore to deliver medicine to the injured Weisz, they are found by the Sylph of the Wind and captured. Shiki, Homura, and Pino receive Rebecca's communications and go to the loading docks, only to find that Rebecca is not there and in her place is the Element 4 Sylph and another \"surprising\" individual.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-04-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/w7wevEaK5a3t0sFyjtP4KTtdtRa.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w7wevEaK5a3t0sFyjtP4KTtdtRa.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/29"},{"id":"4342485","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":30,"title":{"value":"Mediazione","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Although Shiki and Homura want to deliver medicine to Weisz as soon as possible, they struggle with the attacks from Sylph of the Wind and his assistant, Jinn.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-04-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8pGqj1LlpXWbNbcNjxgNJFIOqvn.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8pGqj1LlpXWbNbcNjxgNJFIOqvn.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/30"},{"id":"4410135","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":31,"title":{"value":"Il nostro futuro","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Rebecca is devastated by Shiki's death and Drakken Joe finally explains to her in detail what it is he wants to extract from her. Apparently, she has a very particular Ether Gear.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-05-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1iKB3POEC6ic0uQXqTEs1rfqt70.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1iKB3POEC6ic0uQXqTEs1rfqt70.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/31"},{"id":"4424877","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":32,"title":{"value":"4 contro 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As her Ether Gear powers are activated, Rebecca goes back in time to before the Belial Gore infiltration and offers information to Shiki. Master Noah appears in front of Shiki and the gang, as they arrive at Drakken's hideout and says that he has a message for Rebecca.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-05-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kg5OR8WxjJJKk18giuXIaj7De43.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kg5OR8WxjJJKk18giuXIaj7De43.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/32"},{"id":"4424878","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":33,"title":{"value":"La spada della Edens","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Changing into her Battle Dress, Hermit fights off the Element 4 sniper, Fie. Sister fights Daichi of Earth, Homura battles Sylph of Wind, and Witch stands against Laguna of Water. Meanwhile, Shiki and his gang push forward toward Drakken's hideout.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-05-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aSmyVh5scYChd0khmtNn7Yi9Fqd.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aSmyVh5scYChd0khmtNn7Yi9Fqd.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/33"},{"id":"4424880","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":34,"title":{"value":"Shiki contro Drakken","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Shiki and the gang grasp a secret clue about Drakken Joe. As they discuss strategies for their next course of action, they notice that something is wrong with Labilia… Suddenly, Drakken Joe appears, sensing an Ether reaction. A head-to-head battle between Shiki and Drakken finally begins!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-05-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a0PC9e6fbCZEOnXqUswe2hAXwFR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a0PC9e6fbCZEOnXqUswe2hAXwFR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/34"},{"id":"4475282","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":35,"title":{"value":"L'avvento del Re Demone","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The fierce battle between Shiki and Drakken continues. Drakken activates his Overdrive to overwhelm Shiki, but suddenly Arsenal appears!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-06-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sdX7Sz7Y08TyJkNkfofUlC8r2wW.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sdX7Sz7Y08TyJkNkfofUlC8r2wW.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/35"},{"id":"4492215","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":36,"title":{"value":"Edens One","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"\"You've lived enough, time to sleep,\" says Shiki, who has reached Overdrive and defeated Drakken Joe. However, Weisz's anger does not subside, and he stands over and points his gun at the barely alive Drakken Joe.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-06-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kewoQGNDih4NrUp7p5Y1sj5JlYO.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kewoQGNDih4NrUp7p5Y1sj5JlYO.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/36"},{"id":"4511995","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":37,"title":{"value":"Scontro nello spazio","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Before they venture beyond the cosmos in search of Mother, the Goddess of the Cosmos, Edens Zero visits Granbell at the request of Shiki, where he has an unexpected reunion.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-06-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oDJwwyzLJt4xfZ0oVeg2hqZoHqJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oDJwwyzLJt4xfZ0oVeg2hqZoHqJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/37"},{"id":"4539465","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":38,"title":{"value":"La donna chiamata pirata","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Edens Zero is cornered by Edens One and Shiki and the crew are saved at the nick of time by the space pirate Elsie Crimson. After the battle, Elsie boards Edens Zero and talks to Shiki about something Ziggy had asked her to do a long time ago.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-06-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n6L1911rZEin1D8pPIUpU5RDdpk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n6L1911rZEin1D8pPIUpU5RDdpk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/38"},{"id":"4548311","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":39,"title":{"value":"La mia amata Nadia","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Shiki and the gang get through Dragonfall and arrive at the Aoi Cosmos, which is ruled by Poseidon Nero of the Oración Seis Galáctica, and land on a fire planet, Red Cave, at the suggestion of Witch. The planet is overflowing with Water Ether, and is an environment that is a far cry from a \"fire planet\" covered by the ocean. As the Edens Zero crew enjoy a brief vacation at the ocean, they discover a town beneath the waters...!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-07-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bA7RbwI3kc3CYXcMZTdQvEVqUXu.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bA7RbwI3kc3CYXcMZTdQvEVqUXu.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/39"},{"id":"4560769","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":40,"title":{"value":"Una macchina capace di amare","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Within a temple adorned by reliefs of Mother, Shiki and the group meet Nadia, the temple's guardian. They hear from Nadia that the far end of the temple contains hints to finding Mother, but as they venture deep into the temple, they find a scorching cave…","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-07-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4UTVG9QD1OlwCr7pFLuSDGl9Tmt.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4UTVG9QD1OlwCr7pFLuSDGl9Tmt.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/40"},{"id":"4573187","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":41,"title":{"value":"Vita da cani","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With Laguna's help, Shiki and the gang obtain a hint for finding Mother and leave Red Cave towards the Verdant Planet Foresta. Meanwhile, Elsie's pirate gang, cruising through the Aoi Cosmos on the Skull Fairy, are being pursued by Justice of the Cosmic Government's Interstellar Union Army.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-07-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eAphEMZ3HxIKcYsVBIDKhv6PYWI.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eAphEMZ3HxIKcYsVBIDKhv6PYWI.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/41"},{"id":"4584440","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":42,"title":{"value":"La battaglia di Foresta","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The robots attack the ship and Jin, Kleene and Laguna have to defend their new allies. Meanwhile, on the planet, Shiki and the others are confronted by Poseidon Nero, who has been ordered to eliminate all robots.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-07-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1BgZNIfKX92fltFfyAayrQGUxj8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1BgZNIfKX92fltFfyAayrQGUxj8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/42"},{"id":"4585777","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":43,"title":{"value":"Star Drain","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Shiki confronts Orc from Poseidon Nero's Commando Team \"Beast\". Orc tells Shiki that they were ordered by Nero and are on a mission to cleanse this planet, which was under the control of Ziggy.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-07-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4d3J8ray16GW0M1vhe3hMnvTd64.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4d3J8ray16GW0M1vhe3hMnvTd64.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/43"},{"id":"4585779","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":44,"title":{"value":"Mia adorata ferraglia","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The battle in Foresta continues its course. Rebecca tries to experiment a little more with the use of Cat Leaper, but Hermit meets someone from her past that causes her to relive certain traumas.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-08-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iJFcFeBQB1gMPfcsN6QQZFoYUxG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iJFcFeBQB1gMPfcsN6QQZFoYUxG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/44"},{"id":"4585780","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":45,"title":{"value":"Kiss & Die","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The battle in Foresta rages on and Elsie springs into action to help Shiki when Justice cuts his way.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-08-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ecCCpvIg3RuLlsitlbgZGMUrHF1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ecCCpvIg3RuLlsitlbgZGMUrHF1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/45"},{"id":"4647537","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":46,"title":{"value":"Il sistema apocalisse","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Doomsday System is activated and all of Foresta is in danger.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-08-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aRuL6RAnsfghYmVRg3oz4CycyAE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aRuL6RAnsfghYmVRg3oz4CycyAE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/46"},{"id":"4650769","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":47,"title":{"value":"Oceans 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Now that everyone's back on the ship, Shiki introduces Xenolith, who has some disturbing statements that affect Shiki and his companions. Meanwhile, Oceans 6, Poseidon Nero's group, assembles and prepares for their next move.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-09-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2eOySfIEYjh9TWVML5dOvOt0aYG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2eOySfIEYjh9TWVML5dOvOt0aYG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/47"},{"id":"4650770","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":48,"title":{"value":"Il giorno del giudizio","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Under Xenolith's guidance, Shiki and his friends receive VR \"bondage training\" to overcome decline of Ether levels when they are constrained. During this training, Ziggy suddenly appears and hurts Rebecca with gravity, infuriating Shiki and causing him to break out of his constraints.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-09-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g8sIc5DwxNEFh6CDjN7aD2CoKbb.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g8sIc5DwxNEFh6CDjN7aD2CoKbb.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/48"},{"id":"4650772","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":49,"title":{"value":"Un'oasi nel deserto","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After Poseidon Shura's \"Judgment Day\" declaration, Shiki and his friends decide to think of a way to counterattack. Laguna suggests an idea that will take Edens Zero to the desert of Planet Sandra.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-09-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/svJgXJWyd53kb5E2McEiJqxLZkH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/svJgXJWyd53kb5E2McEiJqxLZkH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/49"},{"id":"4650774","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":50,"title":{"value":"Preludio alla grande guerra di Aoi","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Shiki and Laguna's former companions prepare to launch an attack on Nero and try to stop Orc from placing the bombs on the planet.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-10-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oy2FI0H27eRanRfUvkDrlsYrMMq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oy2FI0H27eRanRfUvkDrlsYrMMq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1/episode/50"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/104711/season/1"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"26":{"checkedAt":1793468971455,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"27":{"checkedAt":1793468971455,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"28":{"checkedAt":1793468971455,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"29":{"checkedAt":1793468971455,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"30":{"checkedAt":1793468971455,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"31":{"checkedAt":1793468971455,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"32":{"checkedAt":1793468971455,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"33":{"checkedAt":1793468971455,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"34":{"checkedAt":1793468971455,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"35":{"chec